{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "MAT",
  "chapter": 28,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the end of the sabbath, as it began to dawn towards the first ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "day",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the week, came Mary Magdalene, and the other Mary to see the sepulcher.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And behold, there was a great earthquake: for the angel of the Lord descended from heaven, and came and rolled back the stone from the door, and sat upon it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His countenance was like lightning, and his raiment white as snow.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And for fear of him the keepers trembled and became as dead ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the angel answered and said to the women, Fear ye not: for I know that ye seek Jesus, who was crucified.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He is not here: for he is risen, as he said. Come, see the place where the Lord lay.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And go quickly, and tell his disciples, that he is risen from the dead, and behold, he goeth before you into Galilee; there shall ye see him: lo, I have told you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they departed quickly from the sepulcher, with fear and great joy; and ran to bring word to his disciples.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And as they were going to tell his disciples, behold, Jesus met them, saying, All hail. And they came, and held him by the feet, and worshiped him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then said Jesus to them, Be not afraid: go tell my brethren, that they go into Galilee, and there shall they see me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now when they were going, behold, some of the watch came into the city, and showed to the chief priests all the things that had been done.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when they were assembled with the elders, and had taken counsel, they gave a large sum of money to the soldiers,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Saying, Say ye, His disciples came by night, and stole him ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "away",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " while we slept.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if this shall come to the governor's ears, we will persuade him, and secure you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So they took the money, and did as they were instructed: and this saying is commonly reported among the Jews until this day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the eleven disciples went away into Galilee, to a mountain where Jesus had appointed them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when they saw him, they worshiped him: but some doubted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jesus came, and spoke to them, saying, All power is given to me in heaven and upon earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Go ye therefore and teach all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.28.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.28.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Teaching them to observe all things whatever I have commanded you: and lo, I am with you always, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the end of the world. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
